  "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/",
  "name": "Kaal Corpus Claim Layer",
  "description": "5,197 atomic, individually citable claims extracted from 128 works published 2004-2026 by Wulf A. Kaal. Each claim carries a source quote, scope conditions, a page locator, the sha256 of its source PDF and a preformatted citation string. 2,037 claims document failure modes. 2,169 typed edges connect claims that restate, extend, supersede, specialize, support or contest one another. This describes one author's corpus; it is not a survey of any field and asserts no ranking.",
